Package: NetFunrankR
Type: Package
Title: Decomposed Network-Proximity Functional Enrichment Analysis
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "AKM", "Azad",
      email = "kazad@imamu.edu.sa",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Functional enrichment analysis of gene lists using shortest-path
    network proximity in a protein-protein interaction network. The proximity
    of a query gene list to each gene set is decomposed into a degree-aware
    overlap component and a beyond-overlap network component, both tested
    against exact (permutation-free) degree-preserving null distributions
    obtained by discrete convolution, and combined with Fisher's method.
    Classical over-representation analysis, permutation-based proximity
    (symmetric and closest distance) and diagnostic plots are included.
